					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Off.</u>
				1.30.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.26.2
			</span></i>.</div>
